\newlabel{fig:watershed-table3}{{6}{23}{A Table3 window containing the missed striped blue ball next to a detected black ball. The merged foreground's distance peak does not provide a sufficiently independent new marker. The seeded label map consequently does not separate the missed ball as a new object}{figure.6}{}}
